SkyLightWindow — https://github.com/Lakr233/SkyLightWindow
Copyright (c) 2025 Lakr Aream
Licensed under the MIT License.

Nocta's `SkyLightBridge` is an independent implementation whose approach — creating a
SkyLight space, raising its absolute level above the lock screen shield, and moving a window
into it — was learned from SkyLightWindow. The SkyLight C function signatures it uses are
factual API declarations. No source was copied verbatim.

Nocta deliberately diverges from SkyLightWindow on one point: its lock screen panel is a
non-activating NSPanel that can never become key or main, so it cannot receive keyboard input.

